OL,3,GNEWSAMayor turns down proposed pay rise
OL,4,Aof #17,200
OL,5,
OL,6,FTees Valley Mayor Ben Houchen has
OL,7,Fturned down a proposed 26.5% salary
OL,8,Frise recommended by an independent pay
OL,9,Freview body.
OL,11,FHe told councillors at a Tees Valley
OL,12,FCombined Authority meeting that he
OL,13,Fwould use his mayoral veto to reject
OL,14,Fthe #17,200 raise, meaning his salary
OL,15,Fwill remain at the #65,000 it has been
OL,16,Fsince 2021/22.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
