OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMayor turns down proposed pay rise
OL,4,Aof #17,200
OL,5,
OL,6,FPosting on social media, the
OL,7,FConservative mayor said: "At a time
OL,8,Fwhen bills are high and people are
OL,9,Fdoing their best to make ends meet, the
OL,10,Flast thing anyone needs is their
OL,11,Fpoliticians spending time talking about
OL,12,Ftheir own pay."
OL,14,FThe authority is currently under Best
OL,15,FValue Notice which requires it to work
OL,16,Fwith the government to make sure public
OL,17,Fmoney is used appropriately.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
